  "embeddedFormula": {
    "author": "Threshold Sample",
    "category": "Custom",
    "defaultColorIterations": 64,
    "defaultIterations": 80,
    "description": "Distance-estimator rendering of the Lorenz attractor as a swept tube. Each DE evaluation re-walks the trajectory with RK4 from a fixed seed and accumulates min-distance to each segment. Tunable \u03c3/\u03b2/\u03c1 for chaos shape; `dt`/iteration count control trajectory length; `worldScale` shrinks the attractor into scene units; `taper` thins the tube along the trajectory.",
    "functionStem": "LorenzTube",
    "id": "com.puppypower.threshold.sample.lorenz-tube",
    "metalSource": "static FORCE_INLINE float3 lorenzDeriv_lz(float3 p, float sigma, float beta, float rho) {\n    return float3(sigma * (p.y - p.x),\n                  p.x * (rho - p.z) - p.y,\n                  p.x * p.y - beta * p.z);\n}\n\nstatic FORCE_INLINE float3 lorenzStep_lz(float3 p, float dt, float sigma, float beta, float rho) {\n    float3 k1 = lorenzDeriv_lz(p, sigma, beta, rho);\n    float3 k2 = lorenzDeriv_lz(p + 0.5f * dt * k1, sigma, beta, rho);\n    float3 k3 = lorenzDeriv_lz(p + 0.5f * dt * k2, sigma, beta, rho);\n    float3 k4 = lorenzDeriv_lz(p + dt * k3, sigma, beta, rho);\n    return p + (dt / 6.0f) * (k1 + 2.0f * k2 + 2.0f * k3 + k4);\n}\n\nstatic FORCE_INLINE float lorenzPointToSeg2_lz(float3 q, float3 a, float3 b, thread float3& outClosest) {\n    float3 ba = b - a;\n    float3 pa = q - a;\n    float t = clamp(dot(pa, ba) / max(dot(ba, ba), 1e-8f), 0.0f, 1.0f);\n    outClosest = a + ba * t;\n    float3 d = q - outClosest;\n    return dot(d, d);\n}\n\nFORCE_INLINE float DE_LorenzTube(float3 pos, FormulaParams fp, float3x3 rot,\n                                 int iterations, int colorIterations,\n                                 thread OrbitData& orbit) {\n    float sigma = max(fp.params[0], 0.01f);\n    float beta  = max(fp.params[1], 0.01f);\n    float rho   = max(fp.params[2], 0.01f);\n    float dtStep = clamp(fp.params[3], 1e-4f, 0.05f);\n    float worldScale = max(fp.params[4], 1e-4f);\n    float tubeR = max(fp.params[5], 1e-4f);\n    float3 seed = float3(fp.params[6], fp.params[7], fp.params[8]);\n    float yOffset = fp.params[9];\n    float taper = clamp(fp.params[10], 0.0f, 1.0f);\n\n    bool hasRotation = hasRot1Precomputed(fp);\n    float3 q = pos;\n    if (hasRotation) q = rot * q;\n    q.y -= yOffset;\n    q /= worldScale;\n    q.z -= 25.0f;\n\n    if (length(seed) < 1e-3f) seed = float3(0.1f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n\n    float3 cur = seed;\n    float minD2 = 1e20f;\n    float3 trapPos = pos;\n    int trapIter = 0;\n    int trapIterations = min(max(colorIterations, 0), iterations);\n\n    int i = 0;\n    for (; i < iterations; ++i) {\n        float3 nxt = lorenzStep_lz(cur, dtStep, sigma, beta, rho);\n        float3 closest;\n        float d2 = lorenzPointToSeg2_lz(q, cur, nxt, closest);\n        if (d2 < minD2) {\n            minD2 = d2;\n            if (i < trapIterations) {\n                trapIter = i;\n                trapPos = closest;\n            }\n        }\n        cur = nxt;\n    }\n\n    float ageT = (float)trapIter / max((float)(iterations - 1), 1.0f);\n    float radius = tubeR * max(1.0f - taper * ageT, 0.05f);\n\n    orbit.trap = minD2;\n    orbit.trapIteration = trapIter;\n    orbit.trapPosition = trapPos;\n    orbit.finalP = q;\n    orbit.iterationsUsed = i;\n\n    return (sqrt(minD2) - radius) * worldScale;\n}\n\nFORCE_INLINE float DE_LorenzTube_Dist(float3 pos, FormulaParams fp, float3x3 rot, int iterations) {\n    float sigma = max(fp.params[0], 0.01f);\n    float beta  = max(fp.params[1], 0.01f);\n    float rho   = max(fp.params[2], 0.01f);\n    float dtStep = clamp(fp.params[3], 1e-4f, 0.05f);\n    float worldScale = max(fp.params[4], 1e-4f);\n    float tubeR = max(fp.params[5], 1e-4f);\n    float3 seed = float3(fp.params[6], fp.params[7], fp.params[8]);\n    float yOffset = fp.params[9];\n\n    bool hasRotation = hasRot1Precomputed(fp);\n    float3 q = pos;\n    if (hasRotation) q = rot * q;\n    q.y -= yOffset;\n    q /= worldScale;\n    q.z -= 25.0f;\n\n    if (length(seed) < 1e-3f) seed = float3(0.1f, 0.0f, 0.0f);\n\n    float3 cur = seed;\n    float minD2 = 1e20f;\n    for (int i = 0; i < iterations; ++i) {\n        float3 nxt = lorenzStep_lz(cur, dtStep, sigma, beta, rho);\n        float3 closest;\n        float d2 = lorenzPointToSeg2_lz(q, cur, nxt, closest);\n        if (d2 < minD2) minD2 = d2;\n        cur = nxt;\n    }\n    return (sqrt(minD2) - tubeR) * worldScale;\n}\n",
    "name": "Lorenz Tube",
